msgctxt "56_Foreign Woman"
msgid "Thank you! Thank you so much!"
msgstr "¡Gracias! ¡Muchísimas gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Date"
msgid "So lemme get this straight. The girl had some crazy\\r\nhypernationalist group coming after her?"
msgstr "Déjame que me aclare. ¿A la chica la estaba \\r\npersiguiendo un grupo ultranacionalista?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah. That's why she hid the baby here. That way at least he\\r\nwould've been safe."
msgstr "Sí. Por eso escondió al bebé aquí. Así al menos \\r\nél estaría a salvo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=7
msgctxt "92_Saejima"
msgid "Real nut jobs in town these days... Ain't how it used to be."
msgstr "Hay cada loco por la ciudad estos días... No es lo que era."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Tanimura"
msgid "The baby was already crying when you stumbled on him, right,\\r\nDate-san?"
msgstr "El bebé ya estaba llorando cuando te lo encontraste,\\r\n¿no, Date?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Tanimura"
msgid "It's a miracle you managed to find him before those sickos\\r\ndid."
msgstr "Es un milagro que te lo llegaras a encontrar antes \\r\nque estos enfermos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Date
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "140_Date"
msgid "You're damn right. Lady Luck was smiling down on us today, that's for sure."
msgstr "Ya te digo. La fortuna hoy nos sonrió a nosotros, definitivamente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "What are you going to do now, ma'am? Those sure won't be\\r\nthe last guys like that who come after you."
msgstr "¿Qué hará ahora, mujer? Probablemente esos no serán \\r\nlos últimos que vendrán a por usted."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Foreign Woman"
msgid "I'd like to leave... but I don't have a visa. Raising my son\\r\nhere is the only choice I have."
msgstr "Me gustaría irme... pero no tengo visado. Criar a mi hijo\\r\naquí es la única opción que me queda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "176_Kiryu"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr "Mm..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Tanimura"
msgid "Life in Kamurocho isn't easy, though.  You should probably\\r\nthink about finding a way home, no matter how difficult that\\r\nmay be."
msgstr "La vida en Kamurocho no es fácil. Tal vez deberías pensar\\r\nen encontrar una forma de volver a casa, por muy difícil\\r\nque sea."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Tanimura"
msgid "But if you really wanna live here, I'll do what I can to\\r\nlend you a hand. Have you ever heard of the Asian Gateway?\\r\nThey'd be glad to help you get settled, find an apartment."
msgstr "Pero si realmente quieres vivir aquí, haré lo que pueda\\r\npara echarte una mano. ¿Has oído hablar de la Red Asia?\\r\nEstarán encantados de ayudarte a encontrar un piso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey, that's a good idea. Of all the guys here, Tanimura's\\r\nthe one you'll wanna stick with."
msgstr "Oye, es una buena idea. De todos los que estamos aquí, \\r\nTanimura es con el que te deberías quedar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Tanimura
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=8
msgctxt "224_Tanimura"
msgid "I don't really have the cash to help her, though..."
msgstr "Aunque no tengo mucho dinero con el que ayudarla..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Akiyama"
msgid "I don't mind coming up to bat on that front. How much are we\\r\ntalking?"
msgstr "No me importa arrimar el hombro en ese ámbito. ¿De cuánto\\r\nestaríamos hablando?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Foreign Woman
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "248_Foreign Woman"
msgid "You'll lend me money? But I don't have any bank statements or proof that I'd be able to pay you back..."
msgstr "¿Me prestarás dinero? Pero no tengo ningún aval bancario \\r\no prueba de que te lo podré devolver..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Akiyama"
msgid "Don't worry about that stuff. All I need you to do is take a\\r\ntest, and we're golden."
msgstr "No te preocupes por ello. Todo lo que necesito es que \\r\nhagas un prueba, y listo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Foreign Woman
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "272_Foreign Woman"
msgid "A... test?"
msgstr "¿Una... prueba?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=19
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P19
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "284_Akiyama"
msgid "Yup. That's how I decide whether or not to lend someone the money they want. As for what it'll be, let me see..."
msgstr "Síp. Así es como decido si le presto dinero a alguien o no. \\r\nEn cuanto a lo que será, déjame ver..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=20
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P20
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "Aha! Have you named your son yet?"
msgstr "¡Aha! ¿Ya le has puesto nombre a tu hijo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Foreign Woman
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "308_Foreign Woman"
msgid "Um, not yet, no..."
msgstr "Eh, no, todavía no..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "In that case, how about you let me name him for you? Do that\\r\nand I'll lend you however much cash you need."
msgstr "En ese caso, ¿qué tal si me dejas nombrarlo? Con eso \\r\nte prestaré todo el dinero que haga falta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "332_Kiryu"
msgid "Some test this is."
msgstr "Vaya prueba."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey, you can't knock the importance of a name! They say\\r\na person's name affects the whole course of their life, you\\r\nknow."
msgstr "¡Oye, no puedes sacarle importancia a un nombre! Dicen \\r\nque el nombre de una persona afecta el resto de su \\r\ncurso vital, ¿sabías?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "356_Akiyama"
msgid "I just want to see what that's like. Without having kids of my own, I mean."
msgstr "Solo quiero saber lo que se siente. \\r\nSin tener hijos propios, claro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "368_Akiyama"
msgid "So? I know I didn't do much to help, and this <Italic>is</Italic> a pretty strange condition... but what do you say?"
msgstr "¿Y bien? Sé que no hice mucho en tu ayuda, y esto <Italic>es</Italic> una \\r\ncondición bastante extraña... ¿pero qué me dices?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Foreign Woman"
msgid "I accept. The five of you saved our lives, so it would be\\r\nan honor if you named my son."
msgstr "Acepto. Los cinco salvaron nuestras vidas, así que \\r\nsería un honor si nombraras a mi hijo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=28
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P28
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "392_Kiryu"
msgid "Looks like you got what you wanted, Akiyama. What'll it be?"
msgstr "Parece que conseguiste lo que querías, Akiyama. ¿Qué será?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=29
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P29
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "404_Akiyama"
msgid "Good question. How about..."
msgstr "Buena pregunta. ¿Qué tal...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P30
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "416_Akiyama"
msgid "How about %s?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal %s?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=31
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P31
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "428_Kiryu"
msgid "%s, huh? Can't think of a better name myself."
msgstr "¿%s, eh? No se me ocurriría uno mejor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Tanimura"
msgid "It's got a nice ring to it, I'll give you that. I say go for\\r\nit."
msgstr "Suena bastante bien, la verdad. Por mí \\r\nadelante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=35
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P35
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=7
msgctxt "476_Saejima"
msgid "%s? Not bad. I was thinkin' you'd go for somethin' goofy, but that's actually kinda good."
msgstr "¿%s? Nada mal. Pensaba que dirías una tontería, pero \\r\nestá bastante bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=36
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P36
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "488_Akiyama"
msgid "Then it's settled! His name will be %s!"
msgstr "¡Entonces está decidido! ¡Su nombre será %s!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=37
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P37
#. y4:msg_speaker=Foreign Woman
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "500_Foreign Woman"
msgid "What a beautiful name! Thank you, all of you! Do you hear that, %s? The nice men gave you a new name."
msgstr "¡Qué nombre más bonito! ¡Gracias a todos! ¿Oyes eso, %s? \\r\nEstos hombres amables te dieron un nuevo nombre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Foreign Woman"
msgid "Please, take this in return. I know it's not much, but I'd\\r\nlike to give you something after all you've done for me."
msgstr "Por favor, quédense con esto a cambio. Sé que no es mucho, \\r\npero me gustaría darles algo después de todo lo que \\r\nhicieron por mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=41
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P41
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=5
msgctxt "548_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh, it was nothing. We're just glad you're okay."
msgstr "Oh, no fue nada. Nos alegra que estén bien."
